OL,3,GNEWSACrisis-hit gender service
OL,4,Acancelled 60 surgeries this year, Welsh
OL,5,Ahealth minister says
OL,6,
OL,7,FAbout 60 surgeries via the Welsh Gender
OL,8,FService (WGS) were cancelled for this
OL,9,Fyear after NHS officials paused
OL,10,Freferrals in August, Wales' health
OL,11,Fminister has revealed.
OL,13,FIt is the first time figures have been
OL,14,Fgiven for the number of people affected
OL,15,Fby the decision to pause referrals over
OL,16,Fconcerns that patients who identify as
OL,17,Ftransgender had been "appropriately
OL,18,Fassessed".
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,439,430,260,140,0,100
