OL,3,GNEWSACrisis-hit gender service
OL,4,Acancelled 60 surgeries this year, Welsh
OL,5,Ahealth minister says
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn a Senedd debate, Welsh Green leader
OL,8,FAnthony Slaughter said patients were
OL,9,Ffacing "unbearable limbo". Reform's
OL,10,FCristiana Emsley said it would be
OL,11,Funacceptable to continue when "serious
OL,12,Fconcerns exist".
OL,14,FHealth Minister Mabon ap Gwynfor said
OL,15,Fhe wanted "to bring certainty" as
OL,16,Fquickly as possible.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
